# choosing a track's engine: FX held + a white key (the picker shows while FX is held); a tap of FX is still SOUND
wait 300
tap FX
wait 100
expect page 2
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 50
expect track 0
press FX
wait 400
shot engine_picker.png
tapkey w8
release FX
wait 300
expect eng 8
expect page 2
expect preset 0
shot beatkit_sound.png
key w0 down 100
wait 200
key w0 up
key w1 down 100
wait 200
key w1 up
key w4 down 100
wait 200
expect voices >0
key w4 up
# HOME + white: its presets
press HOME
tapkey w2
release HOME
wait 300
expect preset 2
# FM on the piano's track
press HOME
tapkey b2
release HOME
wait 50
press FX
tapkey w9
release FX
wait 300
expect eng 9
shot fm_sound.png
key w4 down 90
key w6 down 90
wait 600
expect voices >1
key w4 up
key w6 up
# PLUCK, and HOME + FX's type
press FX
tapkey w10
release FX
wait 300
expect eng 10
shot pluck_sound.png
key w2 down 90
wait 400
expect voices >0
key w2 up
wait 300
# a white key past the engines does nothing
press FX
tapkey w14
release FX
wait 100
expect eng 10
